c2: $ … ⇒ crn (C +: D +: ∅) ⊆ trees ω $ by crn_scons_tail [c1]
h2: $ … ⇒ C ∈ trees ω $ by crn_scons_head_trees [om, c2]
c3: $ … ⇒ crn (D +: ∅) ⊆ trees ω $ by crn_scons_tail [c2]
