l1: $ … ⇒ ap (λₛ i ∈ ω, {y | (i = n ∧ y ∊ x) ∨ (¬ i = n ∧ y ∊ ap w i)}) n = {y | (n = n ∧ y ∊ x) ∨ (¬ n = n ∧ y ∊ ap w n)} $ by clam_ap [#1]
