--| The trees `x` whose numbers add up in every derivable `add y x w`.
def k3_addp (.x .y .w: set): class = $ {x | ∀ y ∀ w (⟨ kr_add , y +: x +: w +: ∅ ⟩ ∈ lrel → nvf' w = nvf' y + nvf' x)} $

