h5: $ … ⇒ suc (nvf' m) = suc (nvf' i + nvf' n) $ by suc_eq [g20]
h6: $ … ⇒ nvf' w = suc (nvf' i + nvf' n) $ by eq_trans [h4, h5]
h7a: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ k3_addp , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_add y z w ∈ lrel , y = i ∧ z = ⟨ kc_s , n +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ w = ⟨ kc_s , m +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_add i n m ∈ lrel ⇒ functional nvf $ by weaken [q0]
