c2a: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ k3_addp , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_add y z w ∈ lrel , ∃ m (y = i ∧ z = ⟨ kc_s , n +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ w = ⟨ kc_s , m +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_add i n m ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ m (y = i ∧ z = ⟨ kc_s , n +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ w = ⟨ kc_s , m +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_add i n m ∈ lrel) $ by ax
c2b: $ … ⇒ nvf' w = nvf' y + nvf' z $ by ex_elim [c2a, h17]
c2c: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ k3_addp , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_add y z w ∈ lrel , ∃ n ∃ m (y = i ∧ z = ⟨ kc_s , n +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ w = ⟨ kc_s , m +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_add i n m ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ n ∃ m (y = i ∧ z = ⟨ kc_s , n +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ w = ⟨ kc_s , m +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_add i n m ∈ lrel) $ by ax
c2d: $ … ⇒ nvf' w = nvf' y + nvf' z $ by ex_elim [c2c, c2b]
